uses for amphibian declines in Puerto Rico</article-title><source>Herpetologica</source><volume>60</volume><fpage>141</fpage><lpage>154</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b19-ehp0114s1-000040"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Capel</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Larson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Effect of scale on the behavior of atrazine in surface waters</article-title><source>Environ Sci Technol</source><volume>35</volume><fpage>648</fpage><lpage>657</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11349273</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b20-ehp0114s1-000040"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Carey</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Rollins-Smith</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Amphibian declines: an immunological perspective</article-title><source>Dev Comp Immunol</source><volume>23</volume><fpage>459</fpage><lpage>472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10512457</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b21-ehp0114s1-000040"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Carr</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gentles</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Goleman</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Urquidi</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Thuett</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Response of larval <italic>Xenopus laevis</italic> to atrazine: assessment of growth, metamorphosis, and gonadal and laryngeal morphology</article-title><source>Environ Toxicol Chem</source><volume>22</volume><fpage>396</fpage